Description: Waveform-marker perf fix only (trimmed from perf-render-repaint.patch)
 Kept for beatgrid-ticks.patch, which needs this refactor as its base. The
 other hunks of perf-render-repaint.patch (library table view) depend on
 patches not in this build (library-ui, usb-browse, ...) and are left out.
Author: Pioneered fork (trimmed for GRV6 build)
Forwarded: no

